{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxMBF7ervnkddHZNbPv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've got enough from the page. I'm stopping at the \"what if\" chart on screen 9 and writing up my answer.\n\nI'd open the account at **פסגות** and buy **אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125**, number 5112628. With the page's example of 10,000 ₪ now and 500 ₪ a month, it says I'd have about **86,045 ₪** after 10 years. I put in 70,000 ₪ of that. I'm fairly sure, but not fully.\n\n**What decided it:** the page already had that account and that fund picked, marked \"★ הזול\", and it came out top of the list. The account part only costs \"1,049 ₪\" over 10 years. At the big banks it's 4,500 to 10,000 ₪. Shekels I take seriously.\n\n**What I didn't like:**\n- The amounts are the page's example, not mine. I've got 30,000 ₪, so my real number would be different. There's a box for \"סכום היום\", but I didn't redo it.\n- I'd never heard of פסגות. לאומי is a name I trust, and it's second at 82,968 ₪, so about 3,000 less. That made me hesitate, and if פסגות feels sketchy I'd probably go with לאומי.\n- The 86,045 also assumes the page's \"7%\" a year and the \"אינפלציה\" button set to \"בכסף של היום\". I didn't really get either.\n\n**How I went through it:**\n1. **Top:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". ת\"א-125 was already selected, and there were boxes for 10,000 ₪, 500 ₪ and 7%.\n2. **Result box:** \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\" and the two cards. Mine said 86,045 ₪ and \"הזוג הבא בתור\" said 85,015 ₪, which is 1,030 ₪ less.\n3. **The bar about 7,323 ₪ in costs:** I looked at the numbers, didn't read it.\n4. **The list of 15 accounts:** names and big numbers only. I skipped the \"לא בחישוב\" notes and the small arrows.\n5. **The fund box:** \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\" and \"קרן מחקה\". The fund company is IBI, a name I know.\n6. **The fund list:** the chosen fund has \"-0.04%\". The others had \"-0.37%\" up to \"-0.54%\" and \"-1,030 ₪\" to \"-1,733 ₪\". All those minus signs put me off them.\n7. **\"What if\" chart on screen 9:** I glanced at it, saw \"18,905 ₪ יותר\" for 12 years and stopped there. I didn't open screens 10 to 13.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"דמי משמרת\", \"נאמן 0.025%\", \"משתנים 0%\", \"העמלות זו על זו\", \"הפסגה נחתך: הסכום ארוך מהשתח\", \"תכלית\", \"MTF\", \"מחזיקה את המניות\", \"כמה דרכים יחד\". I'm also not sure about \"סל\" vs. \"מחקה\" (I think they're the same thing). I'm not sure what \"-0.04%\" means. I guessed it means a small loss each year.\n\n**What bugged me:** the list of 15 accounts is long and they all look the same, so I'd have given up if one hadn't been starred. The legend for the bar colours sits way down below the list, so I never matched them up. And it's not clear if \"פסגות\" is a bank or something else."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1942,"cache_read_input_tokens":19187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1942},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"654c4b5d-4749-4c73-9493-e6815f782c1d","uuid":"e8c3e884-e8a5-456f-b506-b74d8a07e891","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:02:02.456Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxMAzV6cKBGZb2w74pS"}
